// # Modern Database Storage Engines & Query Processing Facade
//
// Logline: Unified standard library facade re-exporting LSM trees, B+Trees, WAL crash recovery, MVCC transactions, SQL query engines, and Vector indexing.
//
// Setup: Master facade importing all 50 database storage and execution submodules.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import LSM tree, B+Tree slotted page, WAL recovery, MVCC, SQL optimizer, and Vector search submodules.
//   2. Re-export typed public constructors and execution facade helpers.
//   3. Maintain unified standard library entry point for high-performance database engine subsystems.

